intake:
  - "Make the already-wired Tauri scripts compile on this Mac"
  - "First ship stays iOS and Android; macOS stays the desk DUT test build"
  - "Recorded blockers only: bundle id underscore, missing iOS gen plist, missing Android gen"
  - "One task decides the uncommitted shell diff S19 did not own"
  - "TQ before the sprint can close"
open_for_append: false
