planned: 2026-09-30

objective: |
  E17 host compile. S19 is closed. Do not reopen S19 tasks. Do not reopen S18.
  S18-T0 live BLE smoke stays deferred until a DUT is present.
  Shell stays Welcome → Home → Catalog → sensor session.
  Settings stay in the AppHeader sheet. Brand stays NaviTrack.
  One live profile: fuel-ble.
  Make these already-wired scripts compile on this Mac:
  bun run macos:build, bun run ios:build, bun run android:build.
  Recorded blockers, not guesses: Tauri rejects
  com.navitrack.dut_configurator because of the underscore;
  ios:build dies in scripts/sync-ios-version.sh because
  src-tauri/gen/apple/NaviTrack_iOS/Info.plist is missing
  (Xcode 26.2 and the iPhoneOS SDK are installed; gen/ is gitignored);
  android:build stops because src-tauri/gen/android is missing
  (SDK at ~/Library/Android/sdk; ANDROID_HOME was unset; CLI asks for tauri android init).
  The six uncommitted shell files are not a feature. T1 decides keep or revert.
  Sequence A → B → C → D → E → F. Sprint stays open until F (TQ) is done.
  OUT: App Store / Play upload, live radio, new protocol commands, FCS changes,
  a second live sensor, RS-485, GPS tile, cloud account, full report wizard,
  thermocompensation, desktop COM, reopening S18 or S19.

